<block wx:if="{{authorized}}"><view class="page printer-page"><view class="eyebrow">PRINTER & KITCHEN RECEIPTS</view><view class="page-title">打印机管理</view><view class="subtitle">前台收银、后厨制作，各有一张清楚的小票。</view><view class="card"><view class="row between"><view class="section-title">{{name || '后厨小票机'}}</view><text class="pill">未连接设备</text></view><view class="subtitle">当前仅保存演示配置，不向真实打印机发送任务。</view><view class="printer-placeholder">▤<view>厨房小票 · 58 mm 示意</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="test">预览测试小票</button></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-title">设备与打印设置</view><view class="field-label">设备名称</view><input class="input" maxlength="20" data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：后厨小票机"/><view class="field-label">演示设备编号（选填）</view><input class="input" maxlength="40" data-field="serial" value="{{serial}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="先留空，连接硬件时再配置"/><view class="field-label">打印联数</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{[1,2,3]}}" wx:key="*this" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="copies" class="chip {{copies === item ? 'selected' : ''}}">{{item}} 联</button></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row between"><view><view class="field-label switch-label">接单后自动打印</view><view class="subtitle">保存偏好，接入设备后实现</view></view><switch color="#ba4b2d" checked="{{autoPrint}}" bindchange="toggle"/></view></view><view class="notice">尚未接入厂商云打印服务，保存设置不会绑定设备，也不会产生打印费用。</view><button class="primary save-printer" bindtap="save">保存演示设置</button><button class="text-button receipt-link" bindtap="orders">查看订单小票 →</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{testOpen}}" class="overlay" bindtap="close"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="row between"><text class="section-title">测试小票预览</text><button class="close" bindtap="close">×</button></view><view class="test-ticket"><view class="ticket-name">{{shopName}}</view><view class="ticket-title">厨房制作单 · 测试</view><view class="ticket-rule"/><view class="row between"><text>A06 桌 / TEST</text><text>{{copies}} 联</text></view><view class="ticket-rule"/><view class="row between"><text>炭烤羊肉串 · 微辣</text><text>× 2</text></view><view class="row between"><text>手打柠檬茶 · 标准</text><text>× 1</text></view><view class="ticket-rule"/><view class="small muted">测试示例，不创建订单，不发送打印。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="close">关闭预览</button></view></view></block>
